WEBVTT

01:30.130 --> 01:34.990
[The Heir]

01:35.340 --> 01:37.950
[Episode 33]

01:38.870 --> 01:43.009
[City Gate of She County,
Huizhou Prefecture]

01:54.560 --> 01:55.759
With way too many refugees right now,

01:55.759 --> 01:56.680
it might lead to turmoil.

01:56.680 --> 01:57.680
Hurry to ask Lord He for instructions

01:57.680 --> 01:59.000
on how to handle this.

01:59.000 --> 01:59.430
Yes.

02:01.400 --> 02:02.710
Mother, Zhengliang.

02:03.640 --> 02:04.570
How was it going?

02:05.760 --> 02:07.620
Thankfully, Zhengliang ran fast

02:07.710 --> 02:09.440
and got to the front of the line.

02:09.560 --> 02:10.800
The price at the rice shop

02:10.800 --> 02:12.080
has increased by 40% to 50%

02:12.080 --> 02:13.430
within half an hour.

02:13.870 --> 02:15.670
This is never going to end, is it?

02:16.280 --> 02:18.880
How are the common people
supposed to survive?

02:20.310 --> 02:21.520
Magistrate He

02:21.960 --> 02:25.220
has already sent officers
to the ink workshop to inform us.

02:25.970 --> 02:27.530
The miners' riot this time

02:27.680 --> 02:29.750
has affected Ningguo and Huizhou.

02:29.870 --> 02:32.910
Also, the Japanese pirates along the river
are using this to pillage everywhere.

02:32.910 --> 02:35.310
The trade routes
in and out of Huizhou are also cut off.

02:35.310 --> 02:36.150
Magistrate He

02:36.150 --> 02:38.850
has called on the merchants of Huizhou
to work with the prefectural office,

02:38.850 --> 02:40.180
giving away porridge to help the needy,

02:40.180 --> 02:43.980
pacifying the refugees,
and getting through this crisis together.

02:45.310 --> 02:47.240
How are things going at the ink workshop?

02:47.240 --> 02:48.240
Don't worry.

02:48.380 --> 02:50.630
For the orders the ink workshop
took previously,

02:50.630 --> 02:52.720
I have prepared sufficient materials.

02:52.720 --> 02:55.579
The delivery of the ink products
won't be a problem.

02:55.800 --> 02:58.490
I heard this time, Marshal Qi will
deploy troops to suppress the rebellion.

02:58.490 --> 03:00.580
It probably won't last for long.

03:01.680 --> 03:02.540
And this gave me

03:02.810 --> 03:05.670
the chance to be back
and spend some time with Mother

03:05.710 --> 03:06.870
and Grandfather.

03:07.030 --> 03:08.680
And I can also talk more

03:08.680 --> 03:09.940
with my unborn nephew.

03:10.240 --> 03:11.240
During this time,

03:11.240 --> 03:12.640
I'll keep watch at night.

03:12.680 --> 03:14.680
Mother, you should also go out less.

03:14.780 --> 03:17.240
If you need to go out,
you must call me to go with you.

03:17.240 --> 03:18.079
Zhen,

03:19.370 --> 03:21.310
how are things going at the main house?

03:21.310 --> 03:24.240
Eldest Aunt has also sent people
to buy food and rice.

03:24.280 --> 03:26.280
Excluding the portion
for porridge distribution,

03:26.280 --> 03:27.540
if they live frugally,

03:27.560 --> 03:30.020
surviving for half a year
won't be a problem.

03:30.120 --> 03:31.030
So don't worry.

03:36.710 --> 03:37.360
Benchang!

03:37.680 --> 03:38.630
Young Master Wu's letter arrived.

03:38.630 --> 03:39.400
Keep it down!

03:48.240 --> 03:49.310
Benchang,

03:49.430 --> 03:50.630
I have found a way

03:50.650 --> 03:52.030
for the matter we discussed before.

03:52.030 --> 03:53.560
Just wait for the good news.

03:53.680 --> 03:55.870
Also, regarding your previous question,

03:55.870 --> 03:58.470
I've sent someone to check
with the Ministry of Revenue.

03:58.470 --> 04:00.120
Qi Jiu's original name

04:00.190 --> 04:01.240
was Wang Fuquan.

04:01.310 --> 04:02.440
He's from the north.

04:02.520 --> 04:04.080
His family has all passed away.

04:04.080 --> 04:05.680
In the 39th year of Jiajing's Reign,

04:05.680 --> 04:06.960
he joined Marshal Qi's army.

04:06.960 --> 04:08.620
There is nothing suspicious.

04:08.680 --> 04:09.750
Best regards, Wu Weishi.

04:09.750 --> 04:10.800
The north?

04:11.630 --> 04:13.710
The 39th year of Jiajing's Reign?

04:15.840 --> 04:17.040
Isn't that...

04:20.269 --> 04:21.070
Bensheng.

04:22.160 --> 04:23.360
Do you remember which year

04:23.360 --> 04:24.890
we moved into this mansion?

04:26.340 --> 04:28.560
Three years ago, when the Luo family fell,

04:28.560 --> 04:31.290
Luo Wensong tried to run away
but failed and died.

04:32.000 --> 04:33.870
Their second young master
managed to escape,

04:33.870 --> 04:36.070
but it was said he also died in the north.

04:36.120 --> 04:37.630
So we moved in.

04:38.390 --> 04:39.750
Go to the posthouse later

04:39.750 --> 04:41.550
and send this letter to Nanjing.

04:43.720 --> 04:45.180
After sending the letter,

04:45.680 --> 04:47.280
go to the prefectural office

04:48.000 --> 04:50.860
and find Officer Zhang,
who is on good terms with us.

04:51.159 --> 04:53.280
What for?

04:56.920 --> 04:59.480
Ask him to pull out the arrest warrants

05:00.800 --> 05:04.200
issued for Luo Wenqian
from the 39th year of Jiajing's Reign.

05:04.360 --> 05:05.090
Understood.

05:05.560 --> 05:08.600
We invited
all the ink workshop managers here today.

05:09.190 --> 05:10.160
I guess

05:10.560 --> 05:12.070
you all know the reason.

05:13.040 --> 05:14.000
Recently,

05:14.240 --> 05:15.900
the miners have been rioting.

05:16.830 --> 05:19.230
Our raw materials can't be transported in,

05:19.750 --> 05:20.480
and the ink

05:20.630 --> 05:21.830
can't be shipped out.

05:22.070 --> 05:23.470
The Huizhou ink industry

05:23.800 --> 05:25.600
is facing another crisis.
